{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15242050","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15242050","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1524205001:0":{"text":"绒利那孩子，怎么一声不吭就往<style=\"highlight\">隐水湖那边</style>跑？我喊都喊不住，还差点被她给撞倒了！","source_cn":"绒利那孩子，怎么一声不吭就往<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34CD3F61CE23DC07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1524205002:1":{"text":"她最近不是一直吵着要去学魔法，不肯去做战士吗？估计又是因为这事，跟她爹娘吵起来了。","source_cn":"她最近不是一直吵着要去学魔法，不肯去做战士吗？估计又是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ECC4C7F795C5E14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1524205003:1":{"text":"怪不得绒利那么伤心，肯定又被她阿娘<style=\"highlight\">嘉</style>骂了。","source_cn":"怪不得绒利那么伤心，肯定又被她阿娘<style=hig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7814C31676E6DC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1524205004:1":{"text":"不是我说，就嘉那个臭脾气，她一发火我都害怕，更别提一个小孩子了！嘉也该学学怎么和孩子相处。","source_cn":"不是我说，就嘉那个臭脾气，她一发火我都害怕，更别提一个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x474B4B053A68F1D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1524205005:1":{"text":"我能理解嘉。毕竟她曾是雅库伯尔最优秀的战士之一，当然想让绒利继续做战士。","source_cn":"我能理解嘉。毕竟她曾是雅库伯尔最优秀的战士之一，当然想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BF494BFA9247150","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_m